  "notes": "Source PDF https://data.x.ai/2025-08-20-grok-4-model-card.pdf (8 printed pages; trailing empty form-feed page ignored). Seed listed only this document; alsoDocuments empty. Covers seed model x-ai/grok-4; API vs Web distinguished via settings.surface. Table 1–3 numbers are fractions as printed; human expert BioLP/VCT baselines in prose are percents. Dual-use Table 3 is with safeguards removed per §2.3. Table 2 reports Grok 4 API only. No named external tester org (UK AISI only supplied the Inspect harness; “third-party testing” for cyber is unnamed). Power-seeking is named as a concern but not measured. No knowledge cutoff, context window, params, license, or training compute. languages disclosure is from refusal-eval translation languages, not a full language list. MASK n=1000 from dataset size. Left level off bio_chem before_mitigation because RMF has no numeric threshold stated for that claim."
